{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/63c469b035c187ee2c42b1742620097c.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span>Step into the shadowy and dangerous Isle of Gallow as a newly turned vampire, abandoned by your maker. <strong>Harrowed World: Portents In Red</strong> is an action RPG that lets you Unleash Your Inner Vampire, designing your very own character and forging your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A night of chaos and confusion marks your passage into undeath. When the dust settles, you are tasked with uncovering the meaning behind the mysterious portents in red. Danger is everywhere, and trust is a rare commodity. Choose your allies and enemies well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, vampire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/4da2163266130aab7417a1926332affa.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Your Inner Vampire:</strong> Craft your character from the ground up. Choose their appearance, style, and the Legacy that defines their dark heritage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Dominion: </strong>Explore the dark sinister streets of the Isle of Gallow, uncovering secrets, taking on tasks, and delving into the mysteries of vampiric society.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Is The Life:</strong> Satisfy your need for blood by feeding on the human inhabitants, through stealth, supernatural control, or your unnatural allure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powers of Darkness:</strong> Employ supernatural powers to manipulate, control or harm those around you. Take on the shape of an animal, show your superior vampiric strength, control the minds of mortals, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Secret: </strong>Keep your true nature hidden from the unsuspecting mortals around you, as you tread the thin line between predator and person. Evade government agents and police officers set on neutralising all threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Powers That Be:</strong> Embrace one of the factions of the alliance that governs undead society or defect and become an outsider.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immortal Enemies:</strong> Confront threats, both human and inhuman, through combat, evasion, or strategy, wielding weapons and supernatural abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Conversations:</strong> Pick dialogue choices with the potential to change the outcome of a task or alter your reputation with a particular faction. Your words have power so choose them wisely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/a9fd37e17240dd921569f40b98afabb9.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span>A dark and twisted version of our world where supernatural creatures hide among humanity. Vampires, magical folk, and other beings compete for power and influence through secret societies, corporate power, and religious sects.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/455f8fe3956319872b3f3ae34aadef6e.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span>Harrowed World takes creatures of myth and folklore reimagining them as concealed predators and tricksters. This vision of the world is dystopian and bleak with both human and inhuman horrors, but most people are blissfully ignorant of the dark forces at work around them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/a5fe606165fdbaa0fae1155d881814c3.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harrowed World is the shared setting and franchise of a growing number of video games and (soon) books, combing elements of gothic horror, adventure, dystopian fiction, drama, science fiction, Lovecraftian horror, and urban fantasy. Experience Harrowed World from a variety of perspectives from the prowling vampire to the monster hunting Beholder.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2529270?t=1758816465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2529270?t=1758816465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/ad6b346cdc8f7af429166171cf91c1ae5892d9ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758816465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/ad6b346cdc8f7af429166171cf91c1ae5892d9ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758816465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This title may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work, like frequent violence or gore. Some players may find elements of the game\u2019s story and characters uncomfortable. This title is not suitable for those who are easily offended by such content. "},"detailed_description":"<h1>WANT MORE VAMPIRE GAMES?</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harrowed World is the shared setting and franchise of a growing number of video games and (soon) books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/6b564c3762a3c9b9f8f95530ac69f63d.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out our <strong>FREE</strong> gothic vampire visual novel, that acts a precursor to this very game. Find 'Harrowed World: What's Past Is Portents' and other Harrowed World games using the 'Check out the entire Harrowed World collection on Steam' link above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dark and unforgiving world where vampires pull the strings of humanity. You are not the hero, you are not the villain, you are nothing but a pawn in schemes that you cannot even begin to understand. Some things are better left secret, kept hidden away from prying eyes. </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/63c469b035c187ee2c42b1742620097c.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span>Step into the shadowy and dangerous Isle of Gallow as a newly turned vampire, abandoned by your maker. <strong>Harrowed World: Portents In Red</strong> is an action RPG that lets you Unleash Your Inner Vampire, designing your very own character and forging your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A night of chaos and confusion marks your passage into undeath. When the dust settles, you are tasked with uncovering the meaning behind the mysterious portents in red. Danger is everywhere, and trust is a rare commodity. Choose your allies and enemies well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, vampire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/4da2163266130aab7417a1926332affa.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Your Inner Vampire:</strong> Craft your character from the ground up. Choose their appearance, style, and the Legacy that defines their dark heritage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Dominion: </strong>Explore the dark sinister streets of the Isle of Gallow, uncovering secrets, taking on tasks, and delving into the mysteries of vampiric society.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Is The Life:</strong> Satisfy your need for blood by feeding on the human inhabitants, through stealth, supernatural control, or your unnatural allure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powers of Darkness:</strong> Employ supernatural powers to manipulate, control or harm those around you. Take on the shape of an animal, show your superior vampiric strength, control the minds of mortals, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Secret: </strong>Keep your true nature hidden from the unsuspecting mortals around you, as you tread the thin line between predator and person. Evade government agents and police officers set on neutralising all threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Powers That Be:</strong> Embrace one of the factions of the alliance that governs undead society or defect and become an outsider.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immortal Enemies:</strong> Confront threats, both human and inhuman, through combat, evasion, or strategy, wielding weapons and supernatural abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Conversations:</strong> Pick dialogue choices with the potential to change the outcome of a task or alter your reputation with a particular faction. Your words have power so choose them wisely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/a9fd37e17240dd921569f40b98afabb9.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span>A dark and twisted version of our world where supernatural creatures hide among humanity. Vampires, magical folk, and other beings compete for power and influence through secret societies, corporate power, and religious sects.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/455f8fe3956319872b3f3ae34aadef6e.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span>Harrowed World takes creatures of myth and folklore reimagining them as concealed predators and tricksters. This vision of the world is dystopian and bleak with both human and inhuman horrors, but most people are blissfully ignorant of the dark forces at work around them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/extras/a5fe606165fdbaa0fae1155d881814c3.avif?t=1758816465\" width=616 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harrowed World is the shared setting and franchise of a growing number of video games and (soon) books, combing elements of gothic horror, adventure, dystopian fiction, drama, science fiction, Lovecraftian horror, and urban fantasy. Experience Harrowed World from a variety of perspectives from the prowling vampire to the monster hunting Beholder.</p>","developers":["Pennyvale Media"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529270/29c6830443865e48eb6af567281879ad8aea8a47/header.jpg?t=1758816465","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Pennyvale Media All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://vi